{"title":"Lightning Degree","synopsis":"RyuYeon kehilangan ayahnya karena penyakit ketika dia baru berusia 10 tahun Dengan keterampilan yang ia pelajari dari ayahnya ia dapat mengukir kayu menjadi patung yang sangat rumit Suatu hari setelah menyelesaikan pahatan orang tuanya RyuYeon disambut oleh seorang lelaki tua yang terkesan dengan pahatannya Pria tua itu melihat potensi pada RyuYeon dan bertanya apakah dia ingin menjadi muridnya Karena RyuYeon tidak punya tempat untuk pergi dan ingin melakukan yang terbaik dalam hidupnya ia menerima tawaran lelaki tua itu","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Awin, Galanthorn","artist":"Awin; Wuzhou","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"9b2478b4-c466-429a-a8bf-f8284f625114","number":"220","title":"Chapter 220","date":"2025-12-26","images":[]},{"id":"69050209-ce6e-42fe-ac2d-d9c15cd2216a","number":"219","title":"Chapter 219","date":"2025-12-24","images":[]},{"id":"3256799d-0d20-4481-902e-a8a066a6c708","number":"218","title":"Chapter 218","date":"2025-12-22","images":[]},{"id":"53a8b441-6bd3-41f0-ae1f-c98568c611a4","number":"217","title":"Chapter 217","date":"2025-12-14","images":[]},{"id":"aed17c4c-6bae-4bbb-9787-7f956618548f","number":"216","title":"Chapter 216","date":"2025-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"7d4de3bd-e038-4b7a-80c2-9fa9e3183bc0","number":"215","title":"Chapter 215","date":"2025-11-12","images":[]},{"id":"4610aaaf-d4b6-4683-ba5c-2c7bafec7a0c","number":"214","title":"Chapter 214","date":"2025-11-01","images":[]},{"id":"8fcc8294-d89b-4670-a0d6-956e3b203fea","number":"213","title":"Chapter 213","date":"2025-09-23","images":[]},{"id":"58fdc70d-f727-44e7-8e9b-a600646641e5","number":"212","title":"Chapter 212","date":"2025-09-05","images":[]},{"id":"2a4c207e-ccf6-4998-a134-9d3ad141bf32","number":"211","title":"Chapter 211","date":"2025-08-27","images":[]},{"id":"11397704-87e6-4601-9053-cc13c1e7511b","number":"210","title":"Chapter 210","date":"2025-08-10","images":[]},{"id":"28424fa6-bcbe-4861-8d2e